-- Imports `shared`, which JL4_LIBRARY_PATH finds in project/lib/ (a folder the
-- deployed service does not look in for a bare name) or, in another run of the
-- tests, in ../outside/ (outside the project). No prelude import: with
-- JL4_LIBRARY_PATH set, the built-in standard library is skipped.
IMPORT shared

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
`double it` MEANS n * 2
